{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经rundll32启动命令行。对应需求：执行。官方：Command Shell Activity Started via RunDLL32。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","endgame-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经rundll32启动命令行","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经rundll32启动命令行\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":21,"rule_id":"9ccf3ce0-0057-440a-91f5-870c6ad39093","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n process.name : (\"cmd.exe\", \"powershell.exe\") and\n  process.parent.name : \"rundll32.exe\" and process.parent.command_line != null and\n  /* common FPs can be added here */\n  not process.parent.args : (\"C:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\SHELL32.dll,RunAsNewUser_RunDLL\",\n                             \"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\*.tmp,zzzzInvokeManagedCustomActionOutOfProc\")\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"},{"id":"T1059.003","name":"Windows Command Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1552","name":"Unsecured Credentials","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1552/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1218.011","name":"Rundll32","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/011/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":316,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now","references":[]}
